  "notes": "Mifflin County's 2026 official results include a 'REP REPRESENTATIVE OF THE REPUBLICAN PRECINCT COMMITTEE <precinct>' contest in all 26 precincts, with 3 to 6 seats each (109 total), so seats_per_precinct is null and seats are labelled Member 1..N. Republican committee contests also appeared on the 2024 primary ballot, which suggests 2-year terms; the 2026 results are the most recent. Seats are filled in order of votes: a ballot candidate with votes = filled; a place held by a named write-in = unknown (Burnham Borough; named write-in winners stay unknown because acceptance isn't public); a tie across the cutoff = unknown; leftover seats = unknown if write-in votes were cast, empty if none. Write-in lines labelled Scattered or Blank count as unnamed write-ins. The county site returned intermittent TLS certificate errors to automated downloads, but the file was fetched successfully. Appointments since the primary are not captured."
